    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP 1D</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Unbounded knapsack</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/coin-change/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 322</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Coin Change</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Greedy fails ({1,3,4} for 6: greedy 4+1+1, best 3+3). Ask instead \"which coin is the last one?\": best[a] = 1 + min over coins c of best[a - c]. Fill a table from 0 up to amount. O(amount · coins) time, O(amount) space.</p>\n"
